#/
    Mosaic has explicit Objective-C interop
    THe compiler can infer when Objective-C linkage is needed
    Use `-framework FrameworkName` to link frameworks, and `-F{SEARCH PATH}` to
    specify search paths for them.

    This program would need compiling with:
        `mscc -framework Foundation -o objc objc.msc`
/#

